        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DE44058TT,  4\" x 4\" Residential Steel Hinge with Security Lock Tabs for Door Jamb and Hinge Leaves</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese extra <b>security door hinges</b> have locking tabs that protrude into the door jamb and join the 2 hinge leaves together when door is closed. Holds a closed door in place even if the door hinges are tampered with (if hinge pins are removed or cut). Also features 2 stud aligners.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DE44058TT-specifications.jpg?v=1704354722\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DE44058TT Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDirect fit replacement for THERMA-TRU door hinges (4 Inch Square & Rounded Corner). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching finish flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 3/4\" wood screws.  Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Security Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>THERMA-TRU Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Security Tabs: Lock Tab for Door Jamb</li>\r\n<li>Security Tabs: Lock Tab to Join Hinge Leaves</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DE44058TT.pdf?v=1691095316\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DE44058TT Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 x 4 x 5/8 Radius x Sq Corners Steel Hinge with Security Lock Tabs",
                "description": "Deltana DE44058TT - Residential 4 inch x 4 inch x 5/8 Radius Leaf x Square Corner Leaf door hinges with security lock tabs.  Package includes a pair of hinges with matching finish screws in your choice of 9 different finish colors.",
